<title>SOUTH KOREA: Ssangyong Oil to restart CDU operation.</title>
<headline>Ssangyong Oil to restart CDU operation.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Ssangyong Oil Refining Co, a unit of Ssangyong Group, said on Friday it would restart its No 1 crude distillation unit (CDU) on Sunday after an annual maintenance shutdown.</p>
<p>The 93,000 barrels-per-day (bpd) CDU was closed down on June 4, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Ssangyong, South Korea's third largest oil refiner in terms of capacity, has a refining capacity of 443,000 bpd.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
